"""
Source of truth for the /drugs/ page ("Drug of the day"). Edit this file, then run
    python3 scripts/build_drugs.py
to regenerate drugs/data.js and drugs/svg/*.svg (needs RDKit: pip install rdkit).

Computed for you from the SMILES (never type these by hand): molecular formula,
molecular weight, cLogP (Crippen), H-bond donors/acceptors, TPSA, Rule-of-5
violations, stereocentre count, and the 2D structure drawing.

Field guide -- keep strings SHORT; the quiz reuses `cls`, `target` and `use` as
multiple-choice options next to other drugs' values, so they must read well as
a one-line answer:
  cls      drug class, <= ~40 chars
  target   molecular target / mechanism headline, <= ~60 chars
  mech     1-2 sentence mechanism
  use      main indication(s), <= ~90 chars
  pk       half_life / bioavailability / metabolism / excretion (approximate; "~")
  adverse  3-4 short bullet strings (the ones worth remembering)
  pearl    a med-chem / history / clinical-pearl sentence or two
"""

